{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-congestion","title":"质量、拥塞控制与统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/quality-congestion","wordCount":1366,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"质量-拥塞控制与统计\">质量、拥塞控制与统计</h1><p>实时媒体跑在尽力而为的互联网上，带宽随时波动、丢包随时发生、抖动无处不在。如果发送端一味按固定码率发，网络一拥堵就大面积丢包、画面崩坏。WebRTC 之所以能在地铁、电梯、弱网里维持可用的通话，靠的是一整套持续估算带宽、抗丢包、控抖动的机制。这一篇拆解 GCC、TWCC、L4S 这些质量保障的引擎，以及如何用 <code>getStats()</code> 把它们暴露成可监控指标。它和 <a href=\"../practice/debugging-interop\">调试、兼容与可观测性</a> 互为表里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要在不知道网络容量的情况下发媒体，发送端必须不断「探测—反馈—调整」：发出去的包，由接收端反馈到达情况，发送端据此估算可用带宽并调节码率。这套闭环就是拥塞控制。它的产物——带宽估计（bandwidth estimation, BWE）——会驱动编码器调码率、驱动 SFU 选层（见 <a href=\"sfu-mcu-topologies\">SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[发送端发包&lt;br/&gt;带 TWCC 序号] --&gt; B((网络))&#10;  B --&gt; C[接收端记录到达时刻]&#10;  C --&gt; D[TWCC Feedback&lt;br/&gt;回传每包到达信息]&#10;  D --&gt; E[发送端 GCC]&#10;  E --&gt; F[延迟估计器&lt;br/&gt;看到达时延变化]&#10;  E --&gt; G[丢包估计器&lt;br/&gt;看丢包率]&#10;  F --&gt; H[取较小值&lt;br/&gt;目标码率]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[调节编码器码率]&#10;  H --&gt; J[驱动 SFU 选层]\">flowchart TD\n  A[发送端发包&lt;br/&gt;带 TWCC 序号] --&gt; B((网络))\n  B --&gt; C[接收端记录到达时刻]\n  C --&gt; D[TWCC Feedback&lt;br/&gt;回传每包到达信息]\n  D --&gt; E[发送端 GCC]\n  E --&gt; F[延迟估计器&lt;br/&gt;看到达时延变化]\n  E --&gt; G[丢包估计器&lt;br/&gt;看丢包率]\n  F --&gt; H[取较小值&lt;br/&gt;目标码率]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[调节编码器码率]\n  H --&gt; J[驱动 SFU 选层]</pre><p>下表区分实时媒体里几个常被混淆的质量维度，它们各有对策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>主要对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带宽不足</td>\n<td>链路容量低于码率</td>\n<td>拥塞控制降码率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢包</td>\n<td>包在途中丢失</td>\n<td>NACK 重传 / FEC 前向纠错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抖动</td>\n<td>包到达时间不均</td>\n<td>抖动缓冲（jitter buffer）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>端到端时延</td>\n<td>减小缓冲 / 优化路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gcc-google-拥塞控制\">GCC：Google 拥塞控制</h2><p>libwebrtc 的拥塞控制算法是 GCC（Google Congestion Control）。它的精妙在于双估计器并行：一个延迟估计器，通过 TWCC 反馈观察每个包的到达时延变化——当排队时延上升，说明网络开始拥堵，先于丢包就降速（这是它比纯丢包算法领先之处）；一个丢包估计器，按丢包率调整。最终取两者较小值作为目标码率。</p>\n<p>丢包估计器用一个分段规则调整发送码率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：丢包率低于 2% 时缓增，高于 10% 时按丢包率折减，中间维持。其折减部分可近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_s = A_s \\cdot (1 - 0.5 \\cdot p_{\\text{loss}}), \\quad p_{\\text{loss}} &gt; 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>延迟估计器则用一个自适应阈值判断时延趋势是「上升/平稳/下降」，对应「减速/保持/加速」。两个估计器配合，让 WebRTC 在拥堵刚露头时就温和退让，而非等到大面积丢包才反应。GCC 完全在发送端运行，接收端只需老实回传 TWCC 反馈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"twcc-与新一代反馈-l4s\">TWCC 与新一代反馈（L4S）</h2><p>TWCC（Transport-Wide Congestion Control）是 GCC 的眼睛。发送端给每个 RTP 包打一个传输层序号，接收端通过 TWCC Feedback 报文回传「每个序号包是否到达、到达时刻」。这种「逐包、传输级」的反馈让发送端能精确重建网络状况，是现代码率自适应的基础设施（来源：Flussonic, 2026）。</p>\n<p>2026 年这一层正在发生最大变化。新一代反馈格式登场：RFC 8888 定义的 CCFB（Congestion Control Feedback）标准化了反馈格式，而 L4S（Low Latency, Low Loss, Scalable throughput）配合 ECN（显式拥塞通知）让网络设备在队列刚积压时就标记包，而非丢包——发送端据此可实现亚毫秒级排队时延。L4S 需要客户端支持 RFC 8888 ECN 反馈、服务端用 L4S 兼容的可伸缩拥塞控制（来源：ACM MMSys 2026 论文）。</p>\n<p>下表对比两代反馈机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>反馈内容</th>\n<th>拥塞信号</th>\n<th>成熟度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TWCC</td>\n<td>每包到达时刻/丢失</td>\n<td>延迟变化 + 丢包</td>\n<td>2026 主流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RFC 8888 CCFB + L4S/ECN</td>\n<td>每包到达 + ECN 标记</td>\n<td>队列积压标记（不靠丢包）</td>\n<td>2026 快速演进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"getstats-把内部状态变成可监控指标\">getStats：把内部状态变成可监控指标</h2><p>上述机制的运行状态，全部可以通过 <code>RTCPeerConnection.getStats()</code> 读出。它返回一份按对象组织的统计报告，涵盖每条流的码率、丢包、抖动、RTT、帧率、分辨率、编解码器、当前选用的候选对等。这是构建质量监控、自动降级、问题诊断的唯一权威数据源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function collectStats(pc) {&#10;  const report = await pc.getStats();&#10;  const metrics = {};&#10;  report.forEach((stat) =&gt; {&#10;    if (stat.type === &#39;inbound-rtp&#39; &amp;&amp; stat.kind === &#39;video&#39;) {&#10;      metrics.packetsLost = stat.packetsLost;&#10;      metrics.jitter = stat.jitter;&#10;      metrics.framesPerSecond = stat.framesPerSecond;&#10;      metrics.frameWidth = stat.frameWidth;&#10;    }&#10;    if (stat.type === &#39;candidate-pair&#39; &amp;&amp; stat.nominated) {&#10;      metrics.rtt = stat.currentRoundTripTime;&#10;      metrics.availableOutgoingBitrate = stat.availableOutgoingBitrate;&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;  return metrics;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> collectStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  report.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stat.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'inbound-rtp'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'video'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics.packetsLost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.packetsLost;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics.jitter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.jitter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics.framesPerSecond </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.framesPerSecond;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics.frameWidth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.frameWidth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stat.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'candidate-pair'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.nominated) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics.rtt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.currentRoundTripTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metrics.availableOutgoingBitrate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat.availableOutgoingBitrate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metrics;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键实践：<code>getStats</code> 的许多字段是累计值（如 <code>packetsLost</code>、<code>bytesReceived</code>），要得到速率必须对两次采样做差分再除以时间间隔。常用衍生指标包括丢包率、码率、以及综合体验分。一个常用的体验估算把 RTT、抖动、丢包加权成单一分数，便于告警与对比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>QoE</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>RTT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>jitter</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{QoE} = w_1 \\cdot f(\\text{RTT}) + w_2 \\cdot f(\\text{jitter}) + w_3 \\cdot f(p_{\\text{loss}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QoE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jitter</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loss</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把这些指标定期采集上报，就能在生产环境观察通话质量分布、定位弱网用户、验证优化效果——这正是 <a href=\"../practice/debugging-interop\">调试、兼容与可观测性</a> 要系统化的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实时媒体靠「探测—反馈—调整」闭环做拥塞控制，产物带宽估计驱动编码器码率与 SFU 选层。</li>\n<li>GCC 用延迟估计器（看时延趋势，先于丢包退让）+ 丢包估计器并行，取较小值为目标码率，全在发送端运行。</li>\n<li>TWCC 用逐包传输级序号让发送端精确重建网络状况，是码率自适应的眼睛。</li>\n<li>2026 年最大演进是 RFC 8888 CCFB + L4S/ECN：靠队列标记而非丢包，追求亚毫秒排队时延。</li>\n<li>区分带宽/丢包/抖动/延迟四类问题，分别用降码率、NACK/FEC、抖动缓冲、路径优化应对。</li>\n<li><code>getStats()</code> 是质量监控唯一权威源；注意累计值要差分成速率，衍生指标用于告警，详见 <a href=\"../practice/debugging-interop\">调试、兼容与可观测性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"质量、拥塞控制与统计","id":"质量-拥塞控制与统计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GCC：Google 拥塞控制","id":"gcc-google-拥塞控制"},{"level":2,"text":"TWCC 与新一代反馈（L4S）","id":"twcc-与新一代反馈-l4s"},{"level":2,"text":"getStats：把内部状态变成可监控指标","id":"getstats-把内部状态变成可监控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DataChannel 与点对点数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/datachannel-p2p"},"next":{"title":"Web Audio 与音频处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/webaudio-processing"}}